# Claude Code session artifacts
agent-tools/
**/tool-results/
**/scratchpad/
artifact-*.html
caredroid-scorecard*.html

# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# TypeScript incremental-build cache. Currently only ever lands inside an
# already-gitignored dist/ (see backend/tsconfig.json's `incremental: true`,
# no explicit tsBuildInfoFile override -- TS defaults it under outDir), but
# that's true by inheritance, not by an explicit rule -- a future config
# change (e.g. someone setting tsBuildInfoFile outside dist/) could commit a
# stale build cache without this line catching it.
*.tsbuildinfo

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/*.code-workspace
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

.env

# Local RAG in-memory vector index (dev)
backend/.rag-local/

# Local dev static-asset output + collaboration-hub attachment uploads.
# LocalDiskAttachmentStorageProvider writes here in dev; must never be
# committed since uploaded attachments can contain PHI.
backend/public/

